.Dd November 17, 2026
.Dt ULIMIT 1
.Os RavenBSD
.Sh NAME
.Nm ulimit
.Nd POSIX resource-limit command surface
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm
.Op Fl HS
.Op Fl a
.Op Fl cdfnstv
.Op Ar limit
.Sh DESCRIPTION
The
.Nm
utility parses the POSIX resource-limit options and limit value.
.Pp
The RavenBSD ABI has no
.Fn getrlimit
or
.Fn setrlimit
syscall, so a query or assignment reports
.Dq resource limits are not available in this kernel
and exits with status 1. No limit is fabricated.
.Sh EXIT STATUS
Returns 0 only for
.Fl -help ; usage errors exit with status 2 and an unavailable limit
with status 1.
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr sh 1
